=== width 24, Join, Drop, first line None
Meeting notes, week 42

Attendees: Ada, Grace,
Linus. Notes by Ada.

Decisions

1. Ship the parser
   change behind a flag
   first.
2. Move the nightly
   build to 03:00 UTC.
3. Drop support for the
   legacy backend after
   the next release.

Numbers

Metric     Build time
           (s)
Last week  412
This week  388
Change     -6%
────────────────────────
Metric     Test failures
Last week  17
This week  9
Change     -47%
────────────────────────
Metric     Open bugs
Last week  63
This week  58
Change     -8%
────────────────────────
Metric     Median review
           (h)
Last week  5.5
This week  4.0
Change     -27%

Snippets we looked at

The slow path:

  fn lookup(map: &HashMap<String, Vec<u32>>, key: &str) -> usize {
      map.get(key).map(|ids| ids.len()).unwrap_or_default()
  }

And the shell one-liner
that finds the culprit:

  git log --since=1.week --format='%h %s' -- src/parser | head -20

Open questions

• Who owns the flaky
  integration::upload
  test?
• Is the ~~old~~
  benchmark data still
  valid?
• Do we need a second
  staging cluster?

